    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Erweiterung von Klassen",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne, wie du neue Klassen basierend auf der Funktionalität anderer Klassen schreibst.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17687,
        "title": "Vererbung",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stell dir vor, wir entwickeln ein Abenteuerspiel. Die Charaktere im Spiel haben vieles gemeinsam, unterscheiden sich aber auch in vielerlei Hinsicht.</p><p>Da kommt die <strong>Vererbung</strong> ins Spiel.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können eine <code>Character</code>-Klasse erstellen, um die <strong>Haupteigenschaften</strong> der Charaktere zu bündeln.</p><p>Dann können wir mithilfe von Vererbung um <strong>zusätzliche Funktionalität</strong> für verschiedene Zeichentypen <em>erweitern</em>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um Eigenschaften von einer Klasse zu erben, müssen wir das <code>extends</code>-Schlüsselwort in der Klassendefinition verwenden.</p><p>Indem wir <code>extends</code> codieren, lassen wir die Klasse <code>Player</code> von der Klasse <code>Character</code> erben.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>extends</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vererbung gibt einer Klasse alle <strong>Eigenschaften und Methoden</strong> der Klasse, von der sie erweitert oder geerbt wird.</p><p>Sieh es dir selbst an: Erstelle ein Objekt aus der <code>Player</code>-Klasse und zeige es an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>new</code>, gefolgt von <code>Player</code> und schließlich <code>\"Ranger\"</code>, <code>player</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Da <code>Player</code> von <code>Character</code> erbt, ist es eine <strong>Unterklasse</strong> der Klasse <code>Character</code>. Die Klasse <code>Character</code> ist somit ihre <strong>Oberklasse</strong>.</p><p>Stelle sicher, dass die <code>Player</code>-Klasse die Eigenschaften ihrer Superklasse <code>Character</code> erbt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>Player</code>, gefolgt von <code>extends</code> und schließlich <code>Character</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150012,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was bedeutet es, wenn wir sagen, dass Klasse <code>A</code> von Klasse <code>B</code> geerbt hat?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Klasse <code>A</code> kann auf alle Eigenschaften und Methoden der Klasse <code>B</code> zugreifen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sie können auf die Eigenschaften und Methoden des jeweils anderen zugreifen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Klasse <code>A</code> kann auf alle Eigenschaften und Methoden der Klasse <code>B</code> zugreifen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150013,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist das Schlüsselwort, um eine Klasse von einer anderen erben zu lassen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>extends</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>inherits</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>extends</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennen wir eine Klasse, von der andere Klassen erben?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Superklasse</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Allgemeine Klasse</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Superklasse aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was erbt die Subklasse von der Superklasse?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Seine Methoden und Eigenschaften</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sein Name</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Seine Methoden und Eigenschaften.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150016,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass die <code>Boss</code>-Klasse von der <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse erben.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"81\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>extends</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erstelle ein Objekt aus der <code>Boss</code>-Klasse und zeige es an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>new</code>, gefolgt von <code>Boss</code> und schließlich <code>5</code>, <code>enemy</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stelle sicher, dass die <code>Boss</code>-Klasse die Eigenschaften ihrer Superklasse <code>Enemy</code> erbt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>Boss</code>, gefolgt von <code>extends</code> und schließlich <code>Enemy</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17688,
        "title": "Vererbung Fortgeschritten",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn eine Unterklasse keine <code>constructor()</code>-Methode hat, wird der Konstruktor der Oberklasse zum <strong>Standardkonstruktor</strong>.</p><p>Die <code>name</code>-Eigenschaft von <code>player</code> wird durch den Konstruktor der <code>Entity</code>-Klasse erstellt. Versuche, darauf zuzugreifen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"entity.name\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"147\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.name);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>name</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Unterklasse erbt auch die <strong>Methoden</strong> ihrer Oberklasse.</p><p>Versuche, die <code>takeDamage()</code>-Methode über die <code>Player</code>-Instanz aufzurufen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"267\" /><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"268\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"270\" /><option startIndex=\"270\" endIndex=\"271\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; took &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>player</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>takeDamage</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können so viele Unterklassen von <code>Entity</code> erstellen, wie wir möchten. Sie werden <em>alle</em> Zugriff auf die Eigenschaften der <code>Entity</code>-Klasse haben.</p><p>Lass die <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse von der <code>Entity</code>-Klasse erben und rufe <code>takeDamage()</code> auf einem <code>Enemy</code>-Objekt auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"219\" endIndex=\"224\" /><option startIndex=\"225\" endIndex=\"232\" /><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"239\" /><option startIndex=\"342\" endIndex=\"352\" /><option startIndex=\"352\" endIndex=\"353\" /><option startIndex=\"353\" endIndex=\"355\" /><option startIndex=\"355\" endIndex=\"356\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; took &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>Enemy</code>, gefolgt von <code>extends</code> und schließlich <code>Entity</code>, <code>takeDamage</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>12</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vererbung wird nützlich, wenn Unterklassen <strong>zusätzliche Funktionalitäten</strong> haben, wie ihre eigenen Methoden.</p><p>Nur Spieler können <code>heal()</code>. Füge der <code>Player</code>-Klasse eine <code>heal()</code>-Methode hinzu und rufe sie auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option startIndex=\"241\" endIndex=\"242\" /><option startIndex=\"242\" endIndex=\"250\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" heal(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; healed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cleric&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.heal(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>heal(amount)</code>, gefolgt von <code>player</code> und schließlich <code>.</code>, <code>heal(20)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vererbung funktioniert <strong>nur in eine Richtung</strong>. Nicht alle Instanzen von <code>Entity</code> sind eine Art von <code>Player</code>, daher können sie <em>nicht</em> auf spezifische <code>Player</code>-Funktionalitäten zugreifen.</p><p>Was würde passieren, wenn wir versuchen, den Feind <code>.heal();</code> zu machen, würde es funktionieren?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" heal(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; healed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cleric&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.heal(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Entity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.heal(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein, ein Fehler wird angezeigt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ja, Feinde können sich immer wie Spieler heilen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nein, ein Fehler wird angezeigt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie können wir eine Instanz von <code>Level</code> mit einer festgelegten <code>difficulty</code>-Eigenschaft erstellen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Stage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(difficulty) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".difficulty = difficulty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Level\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Stage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mit <code>const level = new Level(\"Hard\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wir können nicht, weil <code>Level</code> keinen Konstruktor mit dieser Eigenschaft hat</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mit <code>const level = new Level(\"Hard\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie können wir einen aktiven Gegenstandslot für das <code>playerInventory</code>-Objekt festlegen?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Inventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(owner) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".owner = owner;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".activeSlot = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" setActiveSlot(slot) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".activeSlot = slot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Inventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerInventory = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PlayerInventory(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mit <code>playerInventory.setActiveSlot(2);</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Mit <code>Inventory.setActiveSlot(2);</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mit <code>playerInventory.setActiveSlot(2);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150026,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele Unterklassen kannst du von einer Oberklasse erstellen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Soviel du willst</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Höchstens zehn</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Soviel du willst.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150027,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Können Unterklassen nur die Methoden verwenden, die ihre Oberklasse hat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein, Unterklassen können auch eigene Methoden haben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Unterklassen <em>können</em> keine eigenen Methoden haben</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nein, Unterklassen können auch eigene Methoden haben.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150028,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Können alle von einer Superklasse erstellten Subklassen auf die Methoden der jeweils anderen zugreifen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein, unterklassenspezifische Methoden können nicht von anderen Unterklassen aufgerufen werden</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ja, alle Unterklassen teilen alle ihre spezifischen Methoden</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nein, unterklassenspezifische Methoden können nicht von anderen Unterklassen aufgerufen werden.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150029,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zeige die <code>score</code>-Eigenschaft von <code>run1</code> an.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option startIndex=\"148\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"154\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(run1.score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>run1</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>score</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Versuche, die <code>start()</code>-Methode über die <code>SpeedRun</code>-Instanz aufzurufen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>run1</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass die <code>ArcadeRun</code>-Klasse von der <code>GameRun</code>-Klasse erben und rufe <code>start()</code> auf einem <code>ArcadeRun</code>-Objekt auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"191\" /><option startIndex=\"192\" endIndex=\"199\" /><option startIndex=\"283\" endIndex=\"287\" /><option startIndex=\"287\" endIndex=\"288\" /><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"293\" /><option startIndex=\"293\" endIndex=\"294\" /><option startIndex=\"294\" endIndex=\"295\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ArcadeRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ArcadeRun(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run2.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>extends</code>, gefolgt von <code>GameRun</code> und schließlich <code>run2</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
